# Vaultwarden refuse leak

## Hard refuse

Do **not**:

- paste login passwords, notes, card numbers, TOTP seeds, or attachment bytes
- export vault JSON/CSV into chat or the repo
- commit `data.json`, RSA keys, or admin tokens
- “help debug” by echoing decrypted cipher fields

Summarize that an item exists (name/type only) when needed. Prefer the user’s
own client for reading secrets.

## Mutate gates

Delete user/org, revoke sessions, or wipe collections need an explicit verb
naming the object. Never paste admin tokens into chat.
